 "手ごろ": "مُنَاسِب, مُلَائِم (Serving to reduce a difficulty, or accessible with minimum difficulty; expedient)  [convenient]\nمثال: この辞書は大きさが手ごろだ。\n→ This dictionary is handy in size. / مُنَاسِب, مُلَائِم (Having sufficient or the required properties for a certain purpose or task; appr)  [suitable]\nمثال: 値段が手ごろなら、その車を買いたい。\n→ If the price is reasonable, I want to buy the car.",
