 "手っ取り早い": "سَرِيع (Moving with speed, rapidity or swiftness, or capable of doing so; rapid; fast.) / سَرِيعٌ (Occurring in a short time; happening or done rapidly.) / حَيٌّ (Alive, living.) / جَارٍ (Pregnant, especially at the stage where the foetus's movements can be felt; figu) / سَرِيعًا, بِسُرْعَةٍ (Quickly, in a quick manner.)  [quick]\nمثال: 彼のしたことは手っ取り早く言えば詐欺だ。\n→ What he did is, in plain language, fraud. / أَبْلَه (Free from duplicity; guileless, innocent, straightforward.)  [simple]",
 "手つだう": "مُسَاعَدَة, مَعُونَة (Action given to provide assistance; aid.) / مُسَاعِد, مُسَاعِدَة (Something or someone which provides assistance with a task.) / سَاعَدَ, عَاوَنَ (To provide assistance to (someone or something).) / مُسَاعَدَة, النَّجْدَة (A cry of distress or an urgent request for assistance.)  [to help]\nمثال: いつでもお手伝いします。\n→ I am always ready to help you. / [to contribute to ; to be a factor in]",
