 "手にかける": "[to take care of ; to bring up under one's personal care] / [to kill with one's own hands] / مِقْبَض (The part of an object which is (designed to be) held in the hand when used or mo)  [to handle (e.g. a job)] / [to request that someone deal with (something)]",
