 "手を着ける": "[to set one's hand to ; to start work on]\nمثال: いずれは手をつけなければならないだろう。\n→ I suppose I've got to get my feet wet sometime. / غَلَّ, اِخْتَلَسَ (To steal or misappropriate money that one has been trusted with, especially to s)  [to embezzle]\nمثال: 州知事は黒い金に手をつけました。\n→ The governor took the money out of a slush fund. / [to have sexual relations ; to have an affair]",
