 "手伝い": "مُسَاعِد, مُسَاعِدَة (One who helps; an aide; assistant; auxiliary.)  [helper]\nمثال: ４年間は彼は最初の値段で芝を刈ってくれたが、その年の終わりに彼はしょっちゅう手伝いを連れていることに気がついた。\n→ For four years, he cut the grass at the original price, but I noticed that toward the end of that year, he had a helper with him quite… / مُسَاعَدَة, مَعُونَة (Action given to provide assistance; aid.) / مُسَاعِد, مُسَاعِدَة (Something or someone which provides assistance with a task.) / سَاعَدَ, عَاوَنَ (To provide assistance to (someone or something).) / مُسَاعَدَة, النَّجْدَة (A cry of distress or an urgent request for assistance.)  [help]\nمثال: 台所でお母さんの手伝いをしていたの。\n→ I helped my mother in the kitchen.",
