 "抽象名詞": "اِسْم مَعْنًى (A noun that denotes an idea, emotion, feeling, quality, generalization, represen)  [abstract noun]\nمثال: 「―osity」は語尾が「―ous」の形容詞から作られる抽象名詞の語尾。\n→ '-osity' is an abstract noun word ending created from the ending of an '-ous' adjective.",
