 "振う": "تَأَرْجَحَ (To rotate about an off-centre fixed point.) / أُرْجُوحَة, مُرْجِيحَة (A hanging seat that can swing back and forth, in a children's playground, for ac)  [to swing] / تَمْرِين, تَدْرِيب (Any activity designed to develop or hone a skill or ability.) / تَمَرَّنَ (To exert for the sake of training or improvement; to practice in order to develo)  [to exercise (e.g. power, ability)]\nمثال: 暴風雨があらん限りの猛威を振るった。\n→ The storm raged in all its fury. / ازدهر (To be successful; to succeed; to be fortunate or prosperous; to thrive; to make )  [to prosper]\nمثال: その仕事に彼は才をふるった。\n→ The job drew out his talent.",
 "振とう": "صَدْمَة (A sudden, heavy impact.) / صَعْقَة (A sudden, heavy impact.) / صَعَقَ (To give an electric shock to.)  [shock]",
 "振り": "تَأَرْجَحَ (To rotate about an off-centre fixed point.) / أُرْجُوحَة, مُرْجِيحَة (A hanging seat that can swing back and forth, in a children's playground, for ac)  [swing] / ظُهُور (The act of appearing or coming into sight; the act of becoming visible to the ey) / مَظْهَر (A thing seen; a phenomenon; an apparition.) / مَظْهَر, شَكْل (The way something looks; personal presence) / شَكْل (Apparent likeness; the way which something or someone appears to others.)  [appearance]\nمثال: 人のふり見て我がふり直せ。\n→ Learn wisdom from the faults of others. / ذريعة (The action of pretending; false or simulated show or appearance; false or hypocr)  [pretense]\nمثال: 私は彼の言っている事がわからないふりをした。\n→ I affected not to understand what he was saying. / [(a customer) coming to restaurant, ryokan, etc. without a reservation or introduction]",
 "振りかえる": "تَغَيَّرَƒ (To become something different.) / غَيَّرَ (To make something into something else.) / تَغْيِير, تَبْدِيل (The process or result of becoming different.) / فَكَّة (Small denominations of money given in exchange for a larger denomination.) / بَاقٍ (Balance of money returned from the sum paid after deducting the price of a purch) / تَغْيِير (A transfer between vehicles.)  [to change (e.g. a bill)]",
 "振りかざす": "رَفَعَ (to cause to rise)  [to raise (esp. overhead)] / مَارَسَ (To exercise (authority or influence) effectively.)  [to wield (e.g. power, authority)]",
 "振りたてる": "لَوَّحَ, رَفْرَفَ (To move one's hand back and forth (generally above the shoulders) in greeting or) / مَوْج, مَوْجَة (A moving disturbance in the level of a body of liquid; an undulation.)  [to wave (i.e. a flag)]",
 "振りまく": "نَثَرَ, تَفَرَّقَ (To (cause to) separate and go in different directions; to disperse.)  [to scatter]\nمثال: 彼女は花に殺虫剤を振りまいた。\n→ She sprayed pesticide on the flowers. / [to lavish (money, charm, etc.)]\nمثال: ヘレンはパーティーでお世辞を振りまいた。\n→ Helen made herself agreeable to everyone at the party.",
 "振りをする": "اِدَّعَى (1. (intransitive or with 'that' clause or 'to' infinitive) T) / زَعَمَ (1. (intransitive or with 'that' clause or 'to' infinitive) T) / تَظَاهَرَ (1. (intransitive or with 'that' clause or 'to' infinitive) T)  [to pretend]\noften after a verb",
