 "振り切る": "اِنْتَفَضَ (To remove (something attached to, on or clinging to an object) by shaking.)  [to shake off] / [to swing completely (bat, club, etc.) ; to take a full swing] / [to break off from (pursuer) ; to pull away]\nمثال: 囚人は連行していた看守の手を振り切って脱走した。\n→ The prisoner broke away from the guards who were holding him. / رَفَضَ (To refuse to accept; to forswear.)  [to reject (request)]",
