 "振り向く": "اِلْتَفَتَ, اِسْتَدَارَ (To physically rotate (usually around a vertical axis) for a half turn (180 degre)  [to turn around]\nمثال: 私が呼んだとき彼は振り向いた。\n→ He turned around when I called.",
 "振り向ける": "دَارَ, أَدَارَ (To make a non-linear physical movement.) / لَفَّ (To make a non-linear physical movement.) / قَلَبَ (To make a non-linear physical movement.) / اِنْقَلَبَ, صَارَ (To change condition or attitude.) / اِنْعِطَاف (A change of direction or orientation.) / دَوْر, نَوْبَة (A chance to use something shared in sequence with others.) / دَوْر, نَوْبَة (A spell of work, especially the time allotted to a person in a rota or schedule.)  [to turn (around)]\nمثال: 彼は顔を振り向けさえしなかった。\n→ He didn't so much as turn his head. / مُنَاسِب (Suitable or fit; proper; felicitous.) / لَائِق (Suitable to the social situation or to social respect or social discreetness; so)  [to appropriate]\nمثال: 企業は規模を縮小し、研究開発にふりむける利益分も減らしています。\n→ Corporations are downsizing and reducing the amount of profits they put back into R&D.",
 "振り回す": "مَارَسَ (To exercise (authority or influence) effectively.)  [to wield]\nمثال: そのように刃物を振り回すことは危険だ。\n→ It is dangerous to wield an edged tool in such a way. / إِظْهَار, عَرْض (A show or spectacle.) / شَاشَة (An electronic screen that shows graphics or text.)  [to display (one's knowledge)] / تَعَسُّف, طُغْيَان (Improper treatment or usage; application to a wrong or bad purpose; an unjust, c) / مَسَبَّة, شَتِيمَة (Coarse, insulting speech; abusive language; language that unjustly or angrily vi) / إِيذَاء جَسَدِيّ (Physical maltreatment; injury; cruel treatment.) / اِنْتِهَاك جَسَدِيّ (Violation; defilement; rape; forcing of undesired sexual activity by one person ) / أَسَاءَ اِسْتِعْمَالَ (To put to a wrong use; to misapply; to use improperly; to use for a wrong purpos) / آذَى (To injure; to maltreat; to hurt; to treat with cruelty, especially repeatedly.) / أَهَانَ, سَبَّ (To attack with coarse language; to insult; to revile; malign; to speak in an off) / اِغْتَصَبَ, اِنْتَهَكَ (To violate; defile; to rape; (reflexive) to masturbate.) / خَدَعَ, غَشَّ (To deceive; to trick; to impose on; misuse the confidence of.)  [to abuse (one's power)] / [to manipulate someone]",
