 "捕らえる": "لُقْطَة (A find, in particular a boyfriend or girlfriend or prospective spouse.) / أَمْسَكَ (to intercept an object in the air etc.) / مَسَكَ (to intercept an object in the air etc.)  [to catch]\nمثال: ついに反逆者は捕らえられ、拘置所に入れられた。\n→ The rebel was ultimately captured and confined to jail. / قَبْضَة (Grip.)  [to grasp (e.g. meaning)]\nمثال: なんであれ物事の本体を捕らえる事が肝心だ。\n→ No matter what the problem is, it's essential to get at the heart of the matter. / أَخَذَ, أَسَرَ (To attract and hold (someone's) attention and interest; to charm, to entrance, t)  [to captivate]",
