 "掛け": "اِئْتِمَان (A privilege of delayed payment extended to a buyer or borrower on the seller's o)  [credit]\nمثال: 長くつき合うには掛けは禁物。\n→ Short accounts make long friends. / لَائِحَة (A draft of a law, presented to a legislature for enactment; a proposed or projec) / فَاتُورَة, حِسَاب (A written note of goods sold, services rendered, or work done, with the price or) / مِنْقَار (The beak of a bird, especially when small or flattish; sometimes also used with )  [bill] / رَاحَة, اِسْتِرَاحَة (Relief from work or activity by sleeping; sleep.) / اِسْتَرَاحَ (To be based on; to rely on something for proof or explanation) / بَاقِيَّة (remainder) / أَثَارَة (remainder)  [rest]\nafter a noun\nمثال: 彼は上着をコート掛けにかけた。\n→ He hung his coat on a hook. / [in the process of (doing) ; midway through]\nafter -masu stem of verb",
 "掛けあわせる": "ضَرَبَ (To perform multiplication on (a number).)  [to multiply] / صَلِيب (A geometrical figure consisting of two straight lines or bars intersecting each ) / صَلِيب (A wooden post with a perpendicular beam attached and used (especially in the Rom) / صَلِيب (Alternative letter-case form of Cross (“the Crucifix, the cross on which Christ ) / عَبْر, خِلَال (The cross product of the previous vector and the following vector.) / عَبَرَ (To move relatively.)  [to cross] / خَلَطَ, مَزَجَ (To stir together.)  [to mix (e.g. paint colours)]",
 "掛ける": "عَلَّقَ (To put up to hang.) / أَغْلَقَ الْخَطّ (To terminate a telephone call, originally by hanging the receiver on its hook or)  [to hang up (e.g. a coat, a picture on the wall)]\nمثال: コートをハンガーに掛けておきなさい。\n→ Put your coat on a hanger. / لَبِسَ, اِرْتَدَى (To don (clothing, equipment, or the like).)  [to put on (e.g. a blanket)]\nمثال: ウエートレスはテーブルの上に白いテーブルクロスをかけた。\n→ The waitress spread a white cloth over the table. / لَبِسَ, اِرْتَدَى (To don (clothing, equipment, or the like).)  [to put on (glasses, etc.)]\nمثال: その婦人は真珠のネックレスをかけていた。\n→ The lady wore a necklace of pearls. / فَعَلَ, صَنَعَ (To create.) / جَعَلَ (To cause to be.) / جَعَلَ (To force to do.) / جَعَلَ (To indicate or suggest to be.)  [to make (a call)]\nمثال: １０円で電話がかけられますか。\n→ Can I make a phone call for ten yen?",
