 "探りを入れる": "مِسْبَار (A small device, especially an electrode, used to explore, investigate or measure) / مِسْبَار (A small, usually uncrewed, spacecraft used to acquire information or measurement)  [to probe]\nمثال: 女性に彼氏がいるかいないかの探りを入れるベストな方法が有れば教えてください。\n→ If there's a good way to sound out whether a woman has a boyfriend or not please tell me.",
