 "控える": "اِمْتَنَعَ (To stop oneself from some action or interference; to abstain; to eschew) / لَازِمَة, قَرَار (The chorus or burden of a song repeated at the end of each verse or stanza.)  [to refrain]\nمثال: あなたは喫煙をひかえるべきです。\n→ You should refrain from smoking. / [to make notes ; to jot down (e.g. phone number)]\nمثال: 先生は生徒たちにそれらの単語をノートに控えておくよう指示した。\n→ The teacher told the pupils to write those words down in their notebooks. / [to be in preparation for ; to be in waiting for]\nمثال: 彼女は入試を控えて神経質になっていた。\n→ She was nervous before the entrance exam. / [to be soon ; to be in the offing]",
