 "掴まる": "[to be caught ; to be arrested]\nusu. 捕まる / قَبْضَة (Grip.)  [to grasp]\nusu. 掴まる\nمثال: つり革につかまりなさい。電車がすぐ動き出すだろうから。\n→ Hold on to the strap. The train will start to move soon. / وَجَدَ, لَقِيَ (To locate.) / لَقِيَّة (Anything that is found (usually valuable), as objects on an archeological site o)  [to find (e.g. proof)] / [to be detained by]",
