 "揃い": "وَضَع (To put (something) down, to rest.) / غَرَبَ (Of a heavenly body, to disappear below the horizon of a planet, etc, as the latt) / مَجْمُوعَة, طَقْم (A matching collection of similar things. (Note the similar meaning in Etymology ) / مَجْمُوعَة (Set theory.)  [set]\nمثال: あのチームはつわものぞろいだ。\n→ That team has nothing but strong players. / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Every individual or anything of the given class, with no exceptions (the noun or) / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Wholly; entirely; completely; totally.) / جَمِيع (Everything that one is capable of.)  [all]\nOften as ぞろい",
