 "揃う": "[to be complete ; to be all present]\nمثال: この手袋は両方がそろっていない。\n→ Their gloves are not in pairs. / مُبَارَاة (Any contest or trial of strength or skill, or to determine superiority.) / شَحّاطَة, شَخَّاطَة (Synonym of fuse, a long wick used to transfer flame to an explosive device.)  [to match] / جَمَعَ (To bring parts of a whole closer.)  [to gather]\nمثال: この図書館には中国語の本がかなりそろっている。\n→ This library has a large collection of Chinese books.",
