 "揉み立てる": "اِنْهَار (To break apart and fall down suddenly; to cave in.) / اِنْهِيَار (The act of collapsing.)  [to collapse] / آلَةُ طِبَاعَة, آلَةُ الطِّبَاعَة (A printing machine.) / صِحَافَة, صَحَافَة (The print-based media (both the people and the newspapers).) / ضَغَطَ (To drive or thrust by pressure, to force in a certain direction.)  [to press]",
