 "描きだす": "دَلَجَ, غَرَفَ (Senses relating to attracting.) / رَسَمَ (Senses relating to attracting.) / قُرْعَة (The act of drawing:)  [to draw]",
 "描き上げる": "اِنْتَهَى, أَكْمَلَ (To finish; to make done; to reach the end.) / كَامِل (With all parts included; with nothing missing; full.) / ذَرِيع (Generic intensifier.)  [to complete]\nمثال: 私は報告書をすっかり書き上げた。\n→ He wrote out a thorough report. / [to write down (e.g. a list) ; to write out]",
