 "描き出す": "دَلَجَ, غَرَفَ (Senses relating to attracting.) / رَسَمَ (Senses relating to attracting.) / قُرْعَة (The act of drawing:)  [to draw]",
 "描き分ける": "دَلَجَ, غَرَفَ (Senses relating to attracting.) / رَسَمَ (Senses relating to attracting.) / قُرْعَة (The act of drawing:)  [to draw (identifiably)]\nusu. 描き分ける\nمثال: 私なんぞには野牛と鹿と馬とを描き分けることなど到底出来ない。\n→ Me? I can't even begin to draw buffalo, deer and horses so you can tell them apart.",
