 "新陳代謝": "تَجْدِيد (The act of renewing.)  [renewal] / أَيْض (complete set of chemical reactions that occur in living cell) / تَمْثِيل غِذَائِيّ (complete set of chemical reactions that occur in living cell) / اِسْتِقْلَاب (complete set of chemical reactions that occur in living cell)  [metabolism]",
 "新香": "مُخَلَّل (A penis.)  [pickles]",
 "新鮮": "طَازَج, طَازَة (Newly produced or obtained; recent.) / عَذْب (Without salt; not saline.)  [fresh]\nمثال: どうやって新鮮な魚をえらぶのですか。\n→ How can I pick out fresh fish?"
}
